    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "Angel spent $\\frac{7}{24}$ of her weekly salary on Monday, $\\frac{1}{4}$ on Tuesday and $\\frac{1}{3}$ of it on Wednesday. What fraction of her salary was left on Thursday?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{1}{8}$",
      "worked": "The fractions spent all refer to her weekly salary.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{7}{24}+\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{3}&=\\frac{7}{24}+\\frac{6}{24}+\\frac{8}{24}\\\\\\frac{7}{24}+\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{3}&=\\frac{21}{24}=\\frac{7}{8}\\\\1-\\frac{7}{8}&=\\frac{1}{8}\\end{align*}$$\n\nShe had $\\frac{1}{8}$ of her weekly salary left on Thursday.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
